    "Id": "mechdef_catapult_iii_CPLT-R1",
    "Name": "Catapult CPLT-R1",
    "Details": "With great effort, RISC Engineers upgraded the Catapult II chassis to an Omnimech level of technology. Employing the most advanced equipment at their disposal, this venerable design's weight was reduced to 55 tons without sacrificing any firepower. The -R1 is a skirmisher configuration, carrying thirty MML tubes and paired light PPCs for combat at any range. Advanced electronics and a jump range of 165m ensure that it can engage any target successfully.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Experimental TC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "cata"
  },
